OL,3,GNEWSALuton has 'no-go zones' for white
OL,4,Apeople, claims MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Conservative MP has defended claims
OL,7,Fhe made during a debate that there are
OL,8,F"no-go zones" in Luton where "white
OL,9,Fpeople won't go".
OL,11,FBlake Stephenson, who represents Mid
OL,12,FBedfordshire, was speaking during a
OL,13,Ffringe event about migration at the
OL,14,FConservative Party conference in
OL,15,FBirmingham.
OL,17,FHe told the BBC that his comments were
OL,18,Fin response to a Luton resident who
OL,19,Fraised the issue, adding: "It reflects
OL,20,Fa reality that many people now feel
OL,21,Fthat parts of the town are unwelcoming
OL,22,Fand unsafe."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
